NOTE ON SCOPE: This license covers the code and documentation in this
repository (protocol documents, scripts, schema definitions, and
non-identifying example data). It does NOT yet cover any recorded EEG
dataset, since no dataset has been collected at the time of writing.

Licensing terms for the collected EEG dataset (once it exists) will be
decided separately, in coordination with the institutional ethics
approval, participant consent terms, and the project supervisor. Human
subjects data typically requires licensing and access-control
considerations beyond a standard open-source license, and this will be
addressed explicitly before any dataset release — see
docs/ethical_considerations.md.
